#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:2
msgid "Self-Sovereign Collaboration"
msgstr "자기 주권형 협업"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:4
msgid ""
"As data privacy laws tighten and geopolitical risk escalates, "
"organizations must rethink how they control and protect communications. "
"Cloud-centric collaboration platforms often introduce legal exposure, "
"third-party monitoring, and cross-border compliance conflicts—putting "
"operations and data at risk. Whether driven by internal policy, "
"regulatory mandates, or national data sovereignty requirements, more "
"organizations are moving toward self-sovereign collaboration models."
msgstr ""
"데이터 프라이버시 법이 강화되고 지정학적 위험이 고조되면서, 조직은 커뮤니케이션을 "
"통제하고 보호하는 방식을 다시 생각해야 합니다. 클라우드 중심 협업 플랫폼은 법적 노출, "
"제3자 모니터링, 국경 간 컴플라이언스 충돌을 일으켜 운영과 데이터를 위험에 빠뜨리곤 "
"합니다. 내부 정책, 규제 의무, 국가 데이터 주권 요구 등 동기가 무엇이든, 점점 더 많은 "
"조직이 자기 주권형 협업 모델로 옮겨 가고 있습니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:6
msgid ""
"Mattermost provides a secure, extensible collaboration platform that "
"delivers full control over data, infrastructure, and compliance posture. "
"Built on a self-hosted, open core foundation, Mattermost supports "
"localized deployments across air-gapped, private cloud, and sovereign "
"environments—ensuring organizations can future-proof operations, meet "
"global compliance demands, and maintain continuous operational continuity"
" without third-party dependencies."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST는 데이터, 인프라, 컴플라이언스 태세에 대한 완전한 통제력을 제공하는 안전하고 "
"확장 가능한 협업 플랫폼입니다. 셀프 호스팅 오픈 코어 기반 위에 만들어진 OKR.BEST는 "
"에어갭, 프라이빗 클라우드, 주권 환경 전반의 현지화된 배포를 지원하여, 조직이 제3자 의존 "
"없이 미래에 대비한 운영을 갖추고, 글로벌 컴플라이언스 요구를 충족하고, 운영 연속성을 "
"지속적으로 유지할 수 있게 합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:8
msgid ""
"Secure, Mission-Focused Collaboration to Enable Faster, Informed "
"Decision-Making across Environments."
msgstr ""
"환경 전반에서 더 빠르고 정보에 기반한 의사 결정을 가능하게 하는 안전한 임무 중심 협업."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:11
msgid ""
"The following mission-ready sovereign collaboration capabilities are "
"available:"
msgstr "다음과 같은 미션 레디 주권 협업 기능을 사용할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:14
msgid "Localized Compliance and Data Control"
msgstr "현지화된 컴플라이언스와 데이터 통제"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:16
msgid ""
"Managing global operations means adhering to regional regulations—without"
" compromising productivity or communication security."
msgstr ""
"글로벌 운영을 관리한다는 것은 생산성이나 커뮤니케이션 보안을 해치지 않으면서 지역별 "
"규제를 준수한다는 뜻입니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:18
#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:30
#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:42
#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:56
msgid "**Benefits**"
msgstr "**이점**"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Meet global compliance mandates** like GDPR and data localization laws "
"by deploying Mattermost in :doc:`public, private, or sovereign cloud "
"environments </product-overview/cloud-subscriptions>` tailored to "
"national regulatory frameworks."
msgstr ""
"**GDPR·데이터 현지화법 등 글로벌 컴플라이언스 의무 충족** — 국가별 규제 프레임워크에 "
"맞춘 :doc:`퍼블릭, 프라이빗 또는 주권 클라우드 환경 "
"</product-overview/cloud-subscriptions>`\\ 에 OKR.BEST를 배포합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Ensure full data control and transparency** with :ref:`self-hosted "
"deployment options <deployment-guide/server/server-deployment-"
"planning:deployment options>` that eliminate exposure to vendor-"
"controlled infrastructure or telemetry."
msgstr ""
"**완전한 데이터 통제와 투명성 보장** — 벤더가 통제하는 인프라나 텔레메트리에 대한 "
"노출을 없애는 :ref:`셀프 호스팅 배포 옵션 <deployment-guide/server/server-"
"deployment-planning:deployment options>`\\ 을 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Audit and enforce compliance behavior** with :ref:`role-based access "
"controls <administration-guide/manage/team-channel-members:advanced "
"access controls>`, :doc:`custom Terms of Service </administration-"
"guide/comply/custom-terms-of-service>`, and :ref:`audit logging "
"<administration-guide/manage/logging:audit logging>` to align with "
"internal and regulatory standards."
msgstr ""
"**컴플라이언스 행동 감사와 강제** — :ref:`역할 기반 접근 통제 "
"<administration-guide/manage/team-channel-members:advanced access "
"controls>`, :doc:`사용자 정의 서비스 약관 "
"</administration-guide/comply/custom-terms-of-service>`, :ref:`감사 로그 "
"<administration-guide/manage/logging:audit logging>`\\ 로 내부 표준과 규제 "
"표준을 준수합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Protect identity and access** using :doc:`SSO integrations "
"</administration-guide/onboard/sso-entraid>`, :doc:`AD/LDAP "
"synchronization </administration-guide/onboard/ad-ldap-groups-"
"synchronization>`, and :doc:`MFA enforcement </administration-"
"guide/onboard/multi-factor-authentication>` for secure authentication "
"across geographies and operational roles."
msgstr ""
"**신원과 접근 보호** — :doc:`SSO 통합 "
"</administration-guide/onboard/sso-entraid>`, :doc:`AD/LDAP 동기화 "
"</administration-guide/onboard/ad-ldap-groups-synchronization>`, "
":doc:`MFA 강제 </administration-guide/onboard/multi-factor-"
"authentication>`\\ 로 지역과 운영 역할 전반에서 안전한 인증을 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:26
msgid "Secure, Sovereign Deployment at Any Scale"
msgstr "어떤 규모에서든 안전한 주권형 배포"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:28
msgid ""
"From national critical infrastructure to defense-grade networks, "
"Mattermost offers flexible deployment models that preserve sovereignty "
"and continuity."
msgstr ""
"국가 핵심 인프라부터 국방급 네트워크까지, OKR.BEST는 주권과 연속성을 보존하는 유연한 "
"배포 모델을 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Deploy in classified, air-gapped, or disconnected environments** using "
":doc:`Kubernetes-based deployments </deployment-guide/server/deploy-"
"kubernetes>` and STIG-hardened container images to support classified "
"operations and sensitive data workflows."
msgstr ""
"**기밀·에어갭·단절 환경에 배포** — :doc:`Kubernetes 기반 배포 "
"</deployment-guide/server/deploy-kubernetes>`\\ 와 STIG 강화 컨테이너 이미지로 "
"기밀 작전과 민감 데이터 워크플로를 지원합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Eliminate third-party monitoring** with full control over "
"infrastructure, encryption keys, access policies, and system-level "
"logging."
msgstr ""
"**제3자 모니터링 제거** — 인프라, 암호화 키, 접근 정책, 시스템 수준 로그를 완전히 "
"통제합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Scale to meet operational growth** with :doc:`horizontal scalability "
"architecture </administration-guide/scale/scaling-for-enterprise>` that "
"supports tens of thousands of users in sovereign environments without "
"degrading performance or control."
msgstr ""
"**운영 성장에 맞춘 확장** — 성능이나 통제력 저하 없이 주권 환경에서 수만 명의 사용자를 "
"지원하는 :doc:`수평 확장 아키텍처 </administration-guide/scale/scaling-for-"
"enterprise>`\\ 를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Maintain operational continuity under cyber or supply chain "
"disruption** using fully self-managed infrastructure that ensures "
"collaboration continues even during cloud outages or external service "
"failures."
msgstr ""
"**사이버·공급망 중단에도 운영 연속성 유지** — 클라우드 중단이나 외부 서비스 장애 "
"중에도 협업이 계속되도록 보장하는 완전 자체 관리형 인프라를 활용합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:38
msgid "Interoperable Mission-Partner Collaboration"
msgstr "상호 운용 가능한 임무 파트너 협업"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:40
msgid ""
"Cross-agency, multinational, or coalition collaboration requires "
"sovereignty without isolation—supporting joint operations while "
"preserving organizational boundaries."
msgstr ""
"기관 간, 다국적 또는 연합 협업에는 고립 없는 주권이 필요합니다. 조직 경계를 보존하면서 "
"합동 작전을 지원해야 하기 때문입니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Create secure shared workspaces** with :doc:`Connected Workspaces "
"Channels </administration-guide/onboard/connected-workspaces>` that "
"synchronize discussions, reactions, and file sharing across trusted "
"organizations—without exposing internal systems."
msgstr ""
"**안전한 공유 워크스페이스 구축** — 내부 시스템을 노출하지 않으면서 신뢰할 수 있는 조직 "
"간에 논의, 반응, 파일 공유를 동기화하는 :doc:`연결된 워크스페이스 채널 "
"</administration-guide/onboard/connected-workspaces>`\\ 을 활용합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Control access across organizations** with :doc:`attribute-based "
"permissions </administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions>` and "
"scoped identity policies to ensure mission alignment and sensitive "
"information segmentation."
msgstr ""
"**조직 간 접근 통제** — :doc:`속성 기반 권한 "
"</administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions>`\\ 과 범위가 지정된 신원 "
"정책으로 임무 정렬과 민감 정보 분리를 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Deploy sovereign AI and workflow automation** in isolated environments "
"using :doc:`air-gapped AI operations </end-user-guide/agents>` and "
":doc:`Collaborative Playbooks </end-user-guide/workflow-"
"automation>`—enabling intelligence and speed without compromising data "
"control."
msgstr ""
"**격리 환경에 주권 AI와 워크플로 자동화 배포** — :doc:`에어갭 AI 운영 "
"</end-user-guide/agents>`\\ 과 :doc:`협업 플레이북 "
"</end-user-guide/workflow-automation>`\\ 으로 데이터 통제력을 해치지 않으면서 "
"인텔리전스와 속도를 확보합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Upgrade legacy platforms** like Skype for Business with modern, "
"compliant tools for secure messaging, screen sharing, and team "
"coordination. :doc:`See Skype for Business replacement options </use-"
"case-guide/on-prem-skype-for-business-replacement>`."
msgstr ""
"**레거시 플랫폼 업그레이드** — Skype for Business 같은 플랫폼을 보안 메시징, 화면 "
"공유, 팀 협조를 위한 현대적이고 컴플라이언스를 준수하는 도구로 교체합니다. :doc:`Skype "
"for Business 대체 옵션 살펴보기 </use-case-guide/on-prem-skype-for-business-"
"replacement>`."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:50
msgid "Unified Collaboration for Secure Workflows"
msgstr "안전한 워크플로를 위한 통합 협업"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:52
msgid ""
"Legacy collaboration tools—such as Skype for Business and other end-of-"
"life platforms—can no longer meet the demands of modern, high-assurance "
"environments. These tools often lack support for mobile security, "
"extensibility, and integration with mission-critical workflows, creating "
"gaps in continuity, control, and user experience."
msgstr ""
"Skype for Business를 비롯한 지원 종료(EOL) 플랫폼 같은 레거시 협업 도구는 더 이상 "
"현대적인 고신뢰 환경의 요구를 충족하지 못합니다. 이런 도구는 모바일 보안, 확장성, 미션 "
"크리티컬 워크플로와의 통합 지원이 부족해 연속성, 통제력, 사용자 경험에 공백을 만듭니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:54
msgid ""
"Mattermost replaces legacy, on-premises communication systems with a "
"modern, sovereign collaboration platform built to support today's "
"security, compliance, and operational agility requirements."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST는 레거시 온프레미스 커뮤니케이션 시스템을 오늘날의 보안, 컴플라이언스, 운영 "
"민첩성 요구를 지원하도록 만들어진 현대적인 주권형 협업 플랫폼으로 대체합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Modernize secure messaging and team coordination** with :doc:`channel-"
"based collaboration </end-user-guide/messaging-collaboration>`, "
":doc:`threaded discussions </end-user-guide/collaborate/organize-"
"conversations>`, and :doc:`file sharing </end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/share-files-in-messages>` that work across web, desktop, and mobile."
msgstr ""
"**보안 메시징과 팀 협조 현대화** — 웹, 데스크톱, 모바일에서 모두 작동하는 :doc:`채널 "
"기반 협업 </end-user-guide/messaging-collaboration>`, :doc:`스레드 토론 "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/organize-conversations>`, :doc:`파일 공유 "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/share-files-in-messages>`\\ 를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:59
msgid ""
"**Replace outdated platforms** like Skype for Business with a scalable, "
":ref:`self-hosted architecture <deployment-guide/server/server-"
"deployment-planning:deployment options>` that delivers enhanced user "
"experience, compliance, and cross-organizational flexibility."
msgstr ""
"**노후 플랫폼 교체** — Skype for Business 같은 플랫폼을 향상된 사용자 경험, "
"컴플라이언스, 조직 간 유연성을 제공하는 확장 가능한 :ref:`셀프 호스팅 아키텍처 "
"<deployment-guide/server/server-deployment-planning:deployment options>`\\ 로 "
"대체합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Protect sensitive information on mobile** using :doc:`enterprise-grade "
"mobile security </security-guide/mobile-security>` including "
":ref:`biometric access <deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-security-"
"features:biometric authentication>`, :ref:`jailbreak detection "
"<deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-security-features:jailbreak and root "
"detection>`, :ref:`screenshot prevention <deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-"
"security-features:screenshot and screen recording prevention>`, and "
"remote wipe—ensuring secure access from personal or field-issued devices."
msgstr ""
"**모바일에서 민감 정보 보호** — :ref:`생체 인증 접근 <deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-"
"security-features:biometric authentication>`, :ref:`탈옥 감지 "
"<deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-security-features:jailbreak and root "
"detection>`, :ref:`스크린샷 방지 <deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-security-"
"features:screenshot and screen recording prevention>`, 원격 초기화를 포함한 "
":doc:`엔터프라이즈급 모바일 보안 </security-guide/mobile-security>`\\ 으로 개인 또는 "
"현장 지급 기기에서의 안전한 접근을 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:61
msgid ""
"**Extend collaboration capabilities** using :doc:`integrated workflows "
"and automations </end-user-guide/workflow-automation>` to replace manual "
"coordination with policy-driven processes."
msgstr ""
"**협업 역량 확장** — :doc:`통합 워크플로와 자동화 "
"</end-user-guide/workflow-automation>`\\ 로 수작업 협조를 정책 기반 프로세스로 "
"대체합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:62
msgid ""
"**Unify teams around a secure, customizable platform** that evolves with "
"your mission and integrates with internal systems via :doc:`webhooks, "
"plugins, and APIs </integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>`."
msgstr ""
"**안전하고 맞춤 가능한 플랫폼으로 팀 통합** — 임무와 함께 진화하며 :doc:`웹훅, "
"플러그인, API </integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>`\\ 를 통해 내부 "
"시스템과 통합됩니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:65
msgid "Get Started"
msgstr "시작하기"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/self-sovereign-collaboration.rst:67
msgid ""
"`Talk to an Expert <https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_ to deploy a "
"sovereign collaboration platform that gives you full control over your "
"data, infrastructure, and compliance. Whether operating in a national "
"defense context, regulated enterprise, or multinational coalition, "
"Mattermost provides the control, transparency, and resilience required to"
" stay mission-ready."
msgstr ""
"데이터, 인프라, 컴플라이언스에 대한 완전한 통제력을 주는 주권형 협업 플랫폼을 "
